<span id="A3.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Findings: There is unchanged moderate left lower lobe atelectasis and bilateral pleural effusions. Linear atelectases in the left mid lung field are again seen, essentially unchanged. Lesion in the right seventh rib is unchanged. Pleurx catheter is seen, unchanged in position at the base of the left lung. There is no evidence of pneumothorax. Pacer is seen with leads appropriately placed within the right and left atria. Mediastinal silhouette is within normal limits with a calcified aorta.</span></span>
