</table></div></div>
</figure>
<div id="A4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">While in the autonomous preference optimization (APO), the initial learning rate is reduced to <math id="A4.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\times 10^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\times 10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math> without the warmup, with the batch size of 2. The visual encoder and text decoder are frozen out of the training. The reinforced custom-tuning consists of 12,132 steps, executed on <math id="A4.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\times 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\times 2</annotation></semantics></math> NVIDIA A100 GPUs. Other training parameters are the same as the fine-tuning.</p>
</div>
</section>
