<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A5.T7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 7</span>: </span><span id="A5.T7.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Evaluation results of diagnostic report generation on MIMIC-CXR with various metrics including BLEU-1/-2/-3/-4, ROUGE-L, METEOR and CIDEr.<span id="A5.T7.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The best-performing models are highlighted in red. The comparison methods include: R2Gen <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib103" title="" class="ltx_ref">103</a>]</cite>, PPKED <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib104" title="" class="ltx_ref">104</a>]</cite>, AlignTrans <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib105" title="" class="ltx_ref">105</a>]</cite>, CMCL <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib106" title="" class="ltx_ref">106</a>]</cite>, Clinical-BERT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib107" title="" class="ltx_ref">107</a>]</cite> ,METransformer <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib32" title="" class="ltx_ref">32</a>]</cite> ,DCL <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib108" title="" class="ltx_ref">108</a>]</cite>, R2GenGPT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">33</a>]</cite> ,PromptMRG <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib109" title="" class="ltx_ref">109</a>]</cite> ,BtspLLM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">34</a>]</cite> ,MambaXray <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib35" title="" class="ltx_ref">35</a>]</cite>, CounterfactRFT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib11" title="" class="ltx_ref">11</a>]</cite></span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
